 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I came to bring fire on the earth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And how I wish it were already kindled",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But I have a baptism to undergo",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And what constraint I am under until it is completed",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you think I came to bring peace on earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No, I tell you, but division",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From now on five in one household will be divided",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three against two and two against three",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Father against son and son against father",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mother against daughter and daughter against mother",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mother-in-law against daughter-in-law",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And daughter-in-law against mother-in-law",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When you see a cloud rising in the west",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You say at once, A storm is coming, and so it happens",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And when the south wind blows, you say",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It will be scorching hot, and it is",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hypocrites, you know how to interpret the face of the earth",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 3.16,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
